@startuml
' Figure 8.2  Events and commands for one itinerary
' Reading order: top to bottom. The airline's fact enters the log; the
' planner turns it into a command with one owner; the gateway's
' result is a new fact that the trail records.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Log" as E <<ops>>
participant "Planner" as P <<ops>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<ops>>
participant "Trail" as T <<evidence>>
E -> P : event: canceled
P -> G : command: rebook
G -> E : event: rebooked
G -[$TRAIL]-> T : effect
E -> P : event: rebooked
P -> P : command: notify
@enduml
